          "id": "edf10218-0534-403c-898b-cd593fd8ea52",
          "name": "List chains supported by LI.FI Earn",
          "request": {
            "name": "List chains supported by LI.FI Earn",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the list of chains that have at least one Earn vault available. Derived from current vault data.\n\n**This endpoint is scoped to LI.FI Earn (vaults).** Only chains where Earn currently has indexed vaults are returned — it is not a general list of all chains the LI.FI platform supports, and it should not be used to determine SDK / Swaps / Bridges chain coverage.\n\nIf you are integrating Swaps or Bridges (via the LI.FI SDK or the main API), call [`GET https://li.quest/v1/chains`](/api-reference/get-information-about-all-currently-supported-chains) instead. That endpoint returns every chain supported by the LI.FI Aggregation API.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "chains"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "a01a9f17-54e3-4c86-90b0-b0522ce565b9",
              "name": "Supported chains",
              "originalRequest": {
